# Operator Pager

**Invariant:** `operator asked to be woken ∨ long away-from-chat wait complete ⇒ POST email-bridge /pager/notify` · `¬ put personal phone/email in skills/rules/packets`.

```bash
SOCK="${EMAIL_BRIDGE_SOCK:-/tmp/universal-protocol/email-bridge.sock}"
curl -sS --unix-socket "$SOCK" \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"subject":"<≤120>","body":"<≤4000>","tag":"<≤40>"}' \
  http://localhost/pager/notify
```

Success: JSON `"status":"sent"`. Subject ≤120 · body ≤4000 · tag ≤40. Awareness pages welcome; interrupt subject **`COME TO IDE`** only when options exhausted.

**Audience:** pager reader = human principal (phone-test so-what) even when a CDP model seat is operator — ¬ interagent conveyor telegrams. CDP mission runners: `cdp-operator-proxy` inv 22(d)–(g). Full recipes: Use the `pager-notify` skill.

email-bridge is ULG fleet infra (`/tmp/universal-protocol/email-bridge.sock`). Mailbox IMAP/`dispatch(tool="email")` stays on `email-tool-dispatch` — do not conflate.
